full-query: "You have an Auto Scaling group of Instances that processes messages from an Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) queue. The Auto Scaling group scales on the size of the queue. Processing involves a third-party web service. The web service is complaining about the number of failed and repeated calls received from you. When the Auto Scaling group scales in, you have noticed that instances are being terminated while they are processing. What cost-effective solution can you use to reduce the number of incomplete processing?"
